# Keep Vercel deployments small (free tier caps total deployment storage at 10 GB).
# The live site only serves web/ and design/ from Vercel;
# structure thumbnails and mmCIF files load from raw.githubusercontent.com / EBI,
# so the large asset folders below never need to be uploaded with a deployment.
/AFmodels/
/models/
/structures/
/backgrounds/
/data/
/images/
/scripts/
/supabase/
/.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/

# Note: patterns must stay root-anchored (leading /) — an unanchored 'data/'
# also matches web/data. Avoid '!' negation rules; Vercel didn't honor them.
